{'symbol': 'DISCK', 'date': '2021-05-21 21:00:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: MONTEVERDE & ASSOCIATES PC ANNOUNCES AN INVESTIGATION OF DISCOVERY, INC. - DISCA', 'text': 'NEW YORK, MAY 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 JUAN MONTEVERDE , FOUNDER AND MANAGING PARTNER AT MONTEVERDE & ASSOCIATES PC, A NATIONAL SECURITIES FIRM RATED\xa0TOP 50\xa0IN THE 2018-2020 ISS SECURITIES CLASS ACTION SERVICES REPORT AND HEADQUARTERED AT THE\xa0EMPIRE STATE BUILDING\xa0IN NEW YORK CITY, IS INVESTIGATING\xa0DISCOVERY, INC. ("DISCA" OR THE "COMPANY") (DISCA)\xa0RELATING TO ITS PROPOSED MERGER WITH AT&T INC. UNDER THE TERMS OF THE AGREEMENT, DISCOVERY;S ENTERTAINMENT AND SPORTS BUSINESSES ARE TO COMBINE WITH WARNERMEDIA TO CREATE A STANDALONE COMPANY. DISCOVERY SHAREHOLDERS ARE EXPECTED TO OWN ONLY 29% OF THE NEW COMPANY.'}